 "name": "Jefferson County KY School Board Districts",
 "type": "Feature Layer",
 "description": "This dataset contains polygons and attributes which represent the eight Jefferson County School Board districts within Jefferson County, KY. The data was generated following the release of the 2010 Census data and was finalized in 2013 after a court ordered redistricting revision. During the redistricting process a number of precinct boundaries were redrawn. Precinct boundaries are the fundamental building blocks of all political layers in Jefferson County, KY.",
